🧩 STEP 2: SET TEXT PROPERTY

✅ Simple version

"Welcome " & User().FullName & "!"


---

🧠 WHAT YOU CAN GET FROM User()

Property	Example

User().FullName	King RJ
User().Email	king@email.com
User().Image	profile picture



